      "content": "i get that, but i really cant get a hold of my doctor right now and it's the weekend. i've taken ibuprofen before and it's always worked fine for my joints. i just need to get through tonight so i can sleep. is there a certain amount that's low enough that it won't be a huge deal? like if i just take one or two small ones?",
